  "description": "The Gold Bar Reload Pod Kit brings a revolutionary twist to the traditional vaping experience. Unlike its single-use counterparts, the Reload features a rechargeable battery unit paired with disposable, prefilled pods, offering both convenience and sustainability. Each pod is filled with 2ml of 20mg nicotine salt e-liquid, designed to deliver up to 600 puffs of rich, satisfying flavour. The pods incorporate cutting-edge Hyper Mesh Coil technology and a dynamic atomiser to ensure a smooth, consistent vape with every draw. Activation is effortlessly simple via draw-activated mechanism, making it an ideal choice for beginners and seasoned vapers alike. The Gold Bar Reload is perfectly suited for those venturing into vaping for the first time, providing a straightforward, mess-free introduction to a vast world of flavours. It also represents an excellent step up for fans of disposable vapes, cutting costs and waste without sacrificing the convenience and quality they've come to expect. The Reload kit features a premium finish and is crafted from quality materials, embodying elegance, and ergonomics in one device. Its sleek design not only looks great but feels comfortable in hand, ensuring your vaping sessions are both stylish and satisfying. The first Rechargeable Gold Bar : A built-in rechargeable battery ensures that your vaping sessions last all day, with USB-C charging available for fast top-ups, reducing the need for constant replacements. Effortless Vaping : The pre-filled, disposable 2ml pods offer a hassle-free switch with no messy refills or coil changes. Just replace the pod and you're ready to go. Flavour First : With over 17 popular flavours available, the Reload kit continues Gold Bar’s legacy of providing diverse, exquisite tastes for every palate. Super-satisfying MTL vaping : Each pod prefilled with 2ml of 20mg Nicotine Salt E-liquid. Eco-Conscious Vaping : By separating the pod from the battery, the Reload reduces waste, offering a more sustainable vaping solution without compromising on quality or experience. The Gold Bar Reload Kit has 17 fantastic flavours to choose from: 24K Mango Banana Ice Blueberry Ice Blueberry Raspberry Cherry Fizz Hawaiian Sunrise Lemon Ice Lemon & Lime Raspberry Watermelon Spearmint Summer Berries Watermelon Ice Ice Pop Vanilla Cream Tobacco Bora Bora Oasis Strawberry Kiwi Watermelon Virginia Tobacco Please note: Charging cable is not supplied. A USB-C cable can be purchased separately. How to set up the Gold Bar Reload Prefilled Pod Vape Kit Shop Gold Bar Reload Refill Pods",
